{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Channel the mysterious energy of the alien flora through the dilapidated systems of your crashed starship. Use buttons and levers to redirect its flow.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/Switch.gif?t=1746120366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infuse components with the life spark. Then plug into sockets to bring life to new areas. Tend the flowers and watch as the changing root systems rewire circuits.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/Prune.gif?t=1746120366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect seed pods and plant them to create new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your scanner to see beneath the surface. Follow the interplay of nature and technology. Learn how it can be used to further your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This charming solar-punk adventure rewards thoughtful interaction with its vibrant world. The unfolding story is as unique as the way you play.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1735350?t=1746120366","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/a8fbdfda0d205fae445a98be13721eec29d88a8e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746120366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/4ed5647c0f3d0299b6edf08d75d45f6ec90c2ded/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746120366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/4ed5647c0f3d0299b6edf08d75d45f6ec90c2ded/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746120366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Channel the mysterious energy of the alien flora through the dilapidated systems of your crashed starship. Use buttons and levers to redirect its flow.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/Switch.gif?t=1746120366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infuse components with the life spark. Then plug into sockets to bring life to new areas. Tend the flowers and watch as the changing root systems rewire circuits.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/Prune.gif?t=1746120366\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect seed pods and plant them to create new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your scanner to see beneath the surface. Follow the interplay of nature and technology. Learn how it can be used to further your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This charming solar-punk adventure rewards thoughtful interaction with its vibrant world. The unfolding story is as unique as the way you play.</p>","developers":["neblagon"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/ac539243212e15291ad78f79e243a702977ae036/header.jpg?t=1746120366","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 10.4<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recomm